# Daily work

Employee flow: locked → open window → type → submit → editable until window ends → locked.

- After submit, the notebook stays editable for that work date (company timezone) until the next day.
- Past days are read-only. `PATCH /daily-work/today` only for your own today entry.
- Editor: no paste, cut, drop, templates, or previous-report import.
- Statuses: PENDING, SUBMITTED, LATE, MISSED. Revalidate the window on submit and update.
